   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UbuntuNet Alliance Conference 2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UbuntuNet Alliance Conference 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

UbuntuNet Alliance h&#xe5;ller en &#xe5;rlig konferens om NREN (National Research and Education Network) i medlemsl&#xe4;nder. 2014 h&#xe5;lls konferensen i Zambia. Sidas insats syftar till att l&#xe5;ta ungef&#xe4;r 25 deltagare fr&#xe5;n s&#xf6;dra och &#xf6;stra Afrika att delta i konferensen. Dessutom kommer alla ICT direkt&#xf6;rer fr&#xe5;n Sida st&#xf6;dda universitet att delta i konferensen f&#xf6;r kompetensh&#xf6;jning och en initial diskussion med Sida om ICT statusen p&#xe5; deras universitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UbuntuNet Alliance will hold its Annual Conference called             UbuntuConnect on the theme &quot;Infrastructure, Innovation, Inclusion&quot; in Zambia in November 2014. The purpose of this contribution is to allow ICT experts from low-income countries to attend the conference. A     special interest is to make it possible for the ICT directors form    the Sida-supported universtities in to participate in the conference.</narrative>
  </description>
